				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Beam Types are the designations found in FDOT standards.<sp count="2"/>The user can also create a coordinate file<sp count="2"/>for a custom shape.<sp count="2"/>Top of the beam is at the y=0 ordinate.</p>
