						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Enter the data only for the trapazoids needed to describe your section.<sp count="2"/>Unneeded values should remain zero. </p>
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Values should be entered sequentially from the top of the beam. <f family="Arial" charset="0">
