						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">If gross section properties are used, then the gross beam section properties are used for all stages except Stage 7 where the gross composite section properties are used.<sp count="2"/>If transformed section properties are used, then the following table applies. </p>
