						<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">The Service I moment in transverse direction is calculated based on the ratio to the longitudinal moment per LRFD 9.7.3.2. </p>
