				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Crital Location for Principal Stress: <region region-id="200877" left="156" top="17621.25" width="89.25" height="18" align-x="218.25" align-y="17630.25" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
